ready: 1
kind: sequence
id: consolidation.seq.schedule
display_id: SEQ-CONSOLIDATION-SCHEDULE
module: consolidation
title: Schedule maintenance runs
summary: >-
  Decides when each stack's sleep, retention, and sync runs start, admits one run per stack at a time,
  and catches up on runs missed while the daemon was stopped.
trigger:
  trigger_kind: event
  text: >-
    Activity is ingested, pending experience passes the volume threshold, the nightly time arrives, the
    daemon starts, or someone asks for a run
operation: consolidation.op.sleep
participants:
- id: trig
  label: Trigger (ingestion, clock, daemon start, or a sleep request)
- id: sched
  is:
  - sys.daemon
  label: Scheduler
  owner: crates/kernled/src/scheduler.rs
- id: db
  is:
  - sys.home
  label: Stack database
items:
- opt:
    when: the daemon has just started
    items:
    - msg:
        from: sched
        to: db
        text: Mark runs left running as abandoned
        ops:
        - op: update
          entity: consolidation.data.run
          index: P1
          where: state = 'running'
          set:
          - state abandoned
          - finished_at now
    - note:
        over:
        - sched
        text: >-
          Request a retention run for every stack whose last one started more than a day ago, and a sleep
          run for stacks with pending work
- msg:
    from: trig
    to: sched
    text: Request maintenance for a stack
    inputs:
    - name: trigger
      source: Activity, volume, nightly, manual, or catch-up
      source_kind: payload
    constants:
    - consolidation.const.sleep-debounce
    - consolidation.const.sleep-time
    - consolidation.const.volume-threshold
- alt:
    branches:
    - when: activity
      items:
      - note:
          over:
          - sched
          text: >-
            Set the stack's sleep due time to the debounce after now; each new activity pushes it later
    - when: volume, manual, or catch-up
      items:
      - note:
          over:
          - sched
          text: Make the sleep run due now
    - when: nightly
      items:
      - msg:
          from: sched
          to: db
          text: Check for pending experience
          ops:
          - op: read
            entity: appraisal.data.appraisal
            returns: any episode waiting for appraisal or replay
          - op: read
            entity: capture.data.raw-entry
            returns: any raw entry without a mark for a raw transition
      - note:
          over:
          - sched
          text: Make the sleep run due now only when work is pending, so idle stacks cost nothing
- loop:
    while: a stack's due time has passed
    items:
    - alt:
        branches:
        - when: the stack's run guard is held
          items:
          - note:
              over:
              - sched
              text: Keep the due time so a follow-up run starts after the current one
        - when: the guard is free
          items:
          - msg:
              from: sched
              to: db
              text: Start the run
              ops:
              - op: insert
                entity: consolidation.data.run
                index: P1
                set:
                - kind
                - trigger
                - state running
                - started_at now
          - alt:
              branches:
              - when: another run is still marked running
                items:
                - note:
                    over:
                    - sched
                    text: Retry at the next tick
              - when: started
                items:
                - msg:
                    from: sched
                    to: sched
                    text: Run the maintenance
                    invokes:
                    - consolidation.seq.sleep
                    - retention.seq.sweep
                    - sync.seq.sync
                - msg:
                    from: sched
                    to: db
                    text: Finish the run
                    ops:
                    - op: update
                      entity: consolidation.data.run
                      by:
                      - id
                      set:
                      - state completed or failed
                      - finished_at now
                      - counters
                      - model_tokens
                      - error
                - opt:
                    when: the run was requested by a sleep call that waits
                    items:
                    - msg:
                        from: sched
                        to: trig
                        text: Stream the run summary
                        reply: true
rationale: |-
  Activity is debounced because sleeping after every turn spends the budget on half-finished work, and episodes cannot close until the session moves on. Retention runs daily for every stack, used or not, because deletion must happen on schedule.

  One run per stack is enforced by the daemon's in-process guard, backed by the partial unique index; one daemon per home makes a persisted lease unnecessary.
